      "problem": "The distance between a post office and a police station in a particular town is $1\\,mi.$ How much is this distance in yards?",
      "worked_solution": "A table showing the customary units of length is given below.\n\n| Name | Symbol | Conversion |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Mile | $\\text{mi}$ | $1\\,\\text{mi}=1760\\,\\text{yd}$ |\n| Yard | $\\text{yd}$ | $1\\,\\text{yd}=3\\,\\text{ft}$ |\n| Foot | $\\text{ft}$ | $1\\,\\text{ft}=12\\,\\text{in}$ |\n| Inch | $\\text{in}$ | $-$ |\n\nSo, $1\\,\\text{mi}$ is equivalent to $1760\\,\\text{yd}.$",
